@startuml
title US-01: Create Item Listing
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber

actor Lender
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant Storage
database DB

Lender -> Frontend : Submit item form + image
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/items (multipart)
Backend -> Backend : Validate JWT & payload

alt Invalid input or file
    Backend --> Frontend : 400 Bad Request
    Frontend --> Lender : Show validation error
else Unauthorized
    Backend --> Frontend : 401 Unauthorized
    Frontend --> Lender : Redirect to login
else Valid
    Backend -> Storage : Save image file
    Storage --> Backend : imageUrl
    Backend -> DB : Save Item (AVAILABLE)
    DB --> Backend : Saved
    Backend --> Frontend : 201 Created
    Frontend --> Lender : Display new listing
end
@enduml
